title: Podcast launch
description: Five steps from a blank page to a promoted first episode.
due: 2026-11-13
columns:
  - To do
  - {title: Doing, color: "#f5a623"}
  - Done
tasks:
  - key: plan
    title: Plan the show
    status: Doing
    note: Format, audience, cadence, name
    body: |
      Decide the premise, the listener, the episode length and the release cadence.
      Shortlist a name and check it is free on the big directories.
    duration: 5
  - key: record
    title: Record the pilot
    needs: [plan]
    duration: 3
  - key: edit
    title: Edit the pilot
    note: Cut, level, add intro and outro
    needs: [record]
    duration: 4
  - key: publish
    title: Publish the pilot
    note: Host it, submit the feed to the directories
    needs: [edit]
    duration: 2
  - key: promote
    title: Promote the launch
    needs: [publish]
    duration: 5
